         <abstract>The Committee on Education and Workforce, to whom was referred the bill (H.R. 3495) to amend the Fair Labor Standards Act of 1938 to clarify the definition of employee as it relates to direct sellers and real estate agents, and for other purposes, having considered the same, reports favorably thereon with an amendment and recommends that the bill as amended do pass.</abstract>
